=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,\\xi,f,S,\\alpha,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(T,\\xi,f,S,\\alpha,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2StationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2StationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3428c2dab618f816\" href=\"?note=3428c2dab618f816\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-stationary-set.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-stationary-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2PressingDownWitness}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2PressingDownWitness}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}pressing\\text{-}down\\text{-}witness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2PressingDownWitness}_S(T,\\xi,f,S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2StationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha)\n\\land\\xi\\in\\kappa\n\\land T\\subseteq S\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2StationarySet}_S(T,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in T\\;(f(\\alpha)=\\xi)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}pressing\\text{-}down\\text{-}witness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2PressingDownWitness}_S(T,\\xi,f,S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2StationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(f(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha)\n\\land\\xi\\in\\kappa\n\\land T\\subseteq S\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2StationarySet}_S(T,\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in T\\;(f(\\alpha)=\\xi)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness now includes the missing regressive hypothesis and a common regular uncountable ambient cardinal.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is a stationary constant-value subset of the stationary domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-stationary-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"3428c2dab618f816","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-stationary-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status"